{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/pulls/20495","id":3145229880,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAD-Lgs67eGY4","html_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/20495","diff_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/20495.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/django/django/pull/20495.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/20495","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/pulls/20495/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/pulls/20495/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/issues/20495/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/django/django/statuses/0de7f06020e5ae3c2d4851d2c544e60759c1b9f0","number":20495,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fixed #35442 -- Prevented N+1 queries in RelatedManager with only().","user":{"login":"Samriddha9619","id":179990299,"node_id":"U_kgDOCrpvGw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179990299?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samriddha9619","html_url":"https://github.com/Samriddha9619","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samriddha9619/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samriddha9619/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samriddha9619/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samriddha9619/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samriddha9619/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samriddha9619/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samriddha9619/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samriddha9619/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samriddha9619/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"ticket-35442\r\n\r\n#### Branch description\r\nThis PR prevents N+1 queries when iterating over a `RelatedManager` queryset that uses `.only()` to exclude the foreign key field.\r\n\r\nPreviously, `ModelIterable` would attempt to optimize the relationship population by accessing the foreign key on the child object. If that key was deferred (via .`only()`), accessing it triggered an immediate SQL query for every row.\r\n\r\nThe fix modifies `ModelIterable` to check `obj.__dict__` first. If the foreign key attributes are missing (deferred), the optimization is skipped, preserving the lazy loading behavior requested by the user.\r\n\r\n**Tests:**\r\n* Added `test_only_related_manager_optimization` in `defer.tests` to verify query count is 1 (previously N+1).\r\n* Updated `defer.tests.DeferTests.test_only` to assert the correct number of deferred fields (3 instead of 2), reflecting that the foreign key is now correctly deferred.\r\n\r\n#### Checklist\r\n- [ ] This PR targets the `main` branch. <!-- Backports will be evaluated and done by mergers, when necessary. -->\r\n- [ ] The commit message is written in past tense, mentions the ticket number, and ends with a period.\r\n- [ ] I have checked the \"Has patch\" ticket flag in the Trac system.\r\n- [ ] I have added or updated relevant tests.\r\n- [ ] I have added or updated relevant docs, including release notes if applicable.\r\n- [ ] I have attached screenshots in both light and dark modes for any UI changes.\r\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-01-05T05:51:48Z","updated_at":"2026-01-13T18:18:14Z","closed_at":"2026-01-13T18:18:14Z","merged_at":"2026-01-13T18:18:14Z","merge_commit_sha":"040bb3eba72eb45020dd025d3f83094a0fcaf22f","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Samriddha9619:ticket-35442-clean","ref":"ticket-35442-clean","repo":{"id":1043217737,"node_id":"R_kgDOPi49SQ","name":"django","full_name":"Samriddha9619/django","owner":{"login":"Samriddha9619","id":179990299,"node_id"